{
  "text": " I totally think we don't know all of the side effects of these vaccines. I mean, we've did, they were unwilling to admit myocarditis at first. They were unwilling to admit blood clots. They were unwilling to admit menstrual cycle disruption. You know, they've been unwilling to admit it. And it was like pulling teeth, getting them to finally admit even to those three. I think there's so many more that I've just even seen in my own life, anecdotally, just experiencing people that got the vaccine and then had total, you know, debilitating symptoms beyond that. Even people I know who were very, very pro vaccine, you know, were very, very into, even into mandates. And then they themselves or somebody or their loved ones had some sort of side effect. And interestingly, they still were very pro vaccine and very pro mandate, which doesn't really make much sense. But that's kind of how the COVID-19 brain has been working. But see, we run out of time. It's all based on trust and authority. Yeah. It's the same reason that I, like I took the two, Moderna's, you can't call me an anti-vaxxer. I've always been taking vaccines when my doctor told me for my entire history. And then what happened is I had one report from a friend who DMed me on Twitter and said, hey, three of my relatives died a week after they got the vaccine and they were perfectly healthy. And I said, that's statistically impossible. And she says, yeah, but they're dead. And that was a shocker for me. And then a week later, I had another case where Tim Damroth, who's my carpet cleaner, came in and he's wearing a mask. And I said, why are you wearing a mask? He says, well, I got vaccinated. And two minutes later, I had a heart attack. I had to spend the night in the hospital. I've never been the same. He has been in constant pain since that day two years ago. And so this is just, that was what motivated me to start to look at the data firsthand and say, look, something's wrong here. Either my friends are lying to me or the authorities are lying to me. And I just recently talked to a former number three person at the FDA. And he says it is extremely corrupt when he tried to go and ask for, hey, what's going on here? He was told basically to shut up and they wouldn't listen to any of his objections about, hey, we got a safety problem here. And he was basically told to shut up. And he was one of the top people at the FDA. So I can assure you that the corruption is there at the FDA. But the people at the FDA, most of the workers at the FDA believe that the people are not corrupt and they're making these decisions based on some knowledge that they have. And it's all based on trust. And all it takes is one person or two people in the right position to basically look the other way on this. And it's like John Sue looking at the 770 safety signals, including the death safety signal in VAERS that's triggered and saying, oh, nothing to see here, folks. Let's not even notify the public that these safety signals triggered.",
